    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18231" root="زند" body-key="z">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زِنَادٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زَنْدٌ</span>; of which it is a pl., and with
which it is also syn. [In the present day it is
commonly applied to <i>A steel for striking fire:</i>
and has for its pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَزْنِدَةٌ</span>.]


